  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A metal <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>&nbsp;forms hexagonal close-packed structure. The total number of voids in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math> of it is _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>21</mn></msup></math> (Nearest integer)</p><p>(Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup></math>)</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "36",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From the diagram of voids in HCP:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0010_cea28593bfc3.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 221px;\" /><br />There are 6 octahedral voids and 12 tetrahedral voids in a HCP unit cell.<br />One unit cell of HCP contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math>&nbsp;voids</p><p>Thus, No. of voids in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math> of hcp</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>18</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>22</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>21</mn></msup></math></p>"
  }
